# Exercises every Catalog endpoint against the compose stack (`docker compose up -d --build`).
# Run the requests top to bottom in the IntelliJ HTTP client; the token requests store tokens for
# the ones after them.

@catalog = http://localhost:8081
@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/ecomm/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Staff token
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=staff@ecomm.local&password=staff

> {% client.global.set("staffToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Customer token
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=demo@ecomm.local&password=demo

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Categories, no token needed
GET {{catalog}}/categories

### Every Product, no token needed
GET {{catalog}}/products

### Products in a category
GET {{catalog}}/products?category=phones

### A Product's detail; variants[0].id is the Variant ID a Cart takes
GET {{catalog}}/products/PHN-PIXEL-9

### A missing Product: 404
GET {{catalog}}/products/NO-SUCH-SKU

### Staff create a Product: 201
POST {{catalog}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "AUD-DEMO-BUDS",
  "name": "Demo Buds",
  "category": "audio",
  "attributes": {"brand": "Demo", "type": "In-ear"},
  "price": {"amountMinor": 4999, "currency": "EUR"},
  "images": ["/images/products/aud-demo-buds/front.jpg"]
}

### Creating it again: 409
POST {{catalog}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "AUD-DEMO-BUDS",
  "name": "Demo Buds",
  "category": "audio",
  "price": {"amountMinor": 4999, "currency": "EUR"}
}

### Staff update it: 200
PUT {{catalog}}/products/AUD-DEMO-BUDS
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Buds 2",
  "category": "audio",
  "attributes": {"brand": "Demo", "type": "In-ear"},
  "price": {"amountMinor": 3999, "currency": "EUR"},
  "images": ["/images/products/aud-demo-buds/front.jpg"]
}

### A Customer may not change Products: 403
PUT {{catalog}}/products/AUD-DEMO-BUDS
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Hijacked", "category": "audio", "price": {"amountMinor": 1, "currency": "EUR"}}

### Nor may anyone without a token: 401
DELETE {{catalog}}/products/AUD-DEMO-BUDS

### Staff delete it: 204
DELETE {{catalog}}/products/AUD-DEMO-BUDS
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Gone: 404
GET {{catalog}}/products/AUD-DEMO-BUDS
